[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0010","text":"日、日花……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0020","text":"不好意思，救护人员————\n日花……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0030","text":"是……\n那个，美琴小姐她————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0040","text":"美琴没事……\n比起那个——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0050","text":"太、太好了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0060","text":"我看到了\n美琴小姐，在看着我"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0070","text":"太好了——————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0080","text":"……你没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0090","text":"没事的……只是稍微摔了一跤而已……\n好痛……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0100","text":"等等……不用勉强站起来\n救护人员马上就来————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0110","text":"不、不用了……真的没事……！\n还能继续……排练…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0120","text":"日花……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0130","text":"那是当然……的……\n我也想把舞台做到最好————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0140","text":"我也是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0142","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0143","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01240000_03_0150","text":"（接上）"}]
